00:39:07,881 --> 00:39:10,150
THE KIND OF GIRL THAT I LOVE,

1588
00:39:10,150 --> 00:39:11,618
THAT I STARTED "TOP MODEL"

1589
00:39:11,618 --> 00:39:12,986
BECAUSE OF.

1590
00:39:12,986 --> 00:39:15,088
AN ORIGINAL.

1591
00:39:15,088 --> 00:39:17,057
BUT WHAT WASN'T ORIGINAL

1592
00:39:17,057 --> 00:39:18,558
WAS YOUR PERFORMANCE.

1593
00:39:18,558 --> 00:39:20,060
THERE WAS A LACK OF COMMITMENT

1594
00:39:20,060 --> 00:39:22,095
AND A LACK OF CONFIDENCE,

1595
00:39:22,095 --> 00:39:23,330
WHICH THE JUDGES SEE

1596
00:39:23,330 --> 00:39:25,432
FROM WEEK TO WEEK.

1597
00:39:25,432 --> 00:39:27,167
AND THEN WE HAVE ALEXANDRIA,

1598
00:39:27,167 --> 00:39:28,168
WHO DID A DECENT JOB

1599
00:39:28,168 --> 00:39:29,269
IN THE COMMERCIAL--

1600
00:39:29,269 --> 00:39:30,136
OR SHALL I SAY

1601
00:39:30,136 --> 00:39:32,906
AN INDECENTJOB.

1602
00:39:32,906 --> 00:39:33,807
IT WAS SEXY

1603
00:39:33,807 --> 00:39:35,609
LEANING TOWARDS SLEAZY.

1604
00:39:35,609 --> 00:39:36,543
BUT I THINK YOU KNOW

1605
00:39:36,543 --> 00:39:37,510
WHY YOU STAND BEFORE ME,

1606
00:39:37,510 --> 00:39:38,745
BECAUSE THERE'S A PATTERN

1607
00:39:38,745 --> 00:39:39,880
DEVELOPING.

1608
00:39:39,880 --> 00:39:40,647
LAST WEEK,

1609
00:39:40,647 --> 00:39:42,015
THE STYLIST COMPLAINED.

1610
00:39:42,015 --> 00:39:42,716
THIS WEEK,

1611
00:39:42,716 --> 00:39:46,419
THE DIRECTOR SAID THE SAME.

1612
00:39:46,419 --> 00:39:47,254
SO WHO STAYS

1613
00:39:47,254 --> 00:39:50,590
IN THIS COMPETITION?

1614
00:39:54,895 --> 00:39:58,798
>> CONFIDENCE WINS, ALEXANDRIA.

1615
00:39:58,798 --> 00:39:59,866
>> (speaks indistinctly)

1616
00:39:59,866 --> 00:40:01,601
>> (whispers indistinctly)

1617
00:40:01,601 --> 00:40:05,105
NOW GO ON, GIRL.

1618
00:40:05,105 --> 00:40:06,273
>> IT'LL BE THE LAST TIME

1619
00:40:06,273 --> 00:40:07,140
THAT I TELL YOU

1620
00:40:07,140 --> 00:40:08,308
THAT YOU COULD POSSIBLY

1621
00:40:08,308 --> 00:40:09,209
BE GOING HOME

1622
00:40:09,209 --> 00:40:10,911
BECAUSE OF ATTITUDE.

1623
00:40:10,911 --> 00:40:12,479
>> IT WILL NEVER HAPPEN AGAIN.

1624
00:40:12,479 --> 00:40:13,580
>> CONGRATULATIONS.

1625
00:40:13,580 --> 00:40:14,314
>> THANK YOU.

1626
00:40:14,314 --> 00:40:15,549
>> YOU'RE STILL IN THE RUNNING

1627
00:40:15,549 --> 00:40:16,383
TOWARDS BECOMING

1628
00:40:16,383 --> 00:40:17,551
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1629
00:40:17,551 --> 00:40:22,088
YOU'RE WELCOME.

1630
00:40:22,088 --> 00:40:23,089
>> I'M MAD AT YOU...

1631
00:40:23,089 --> 00:40:24,291
>> I KNOW. I'M SO SORRY.

1632
00:40:24,291 --> 00:40:25,158
>> 'CAUSE...

1633
00:40:25,158 --> 00:40:26,159
ONE OF MY FAVORITES.

1634
00:40:26,159 --> 00:40:27,160
I MEAN, LOOK AT YOU.

1635
00:40:27,160 --> 00:40:28,662
>> I WANNA HUG YOU!

1636
00:40:28,662 --> 00:40:29,696
>> BUT, OH, MY GOD.

1637
00:40:29,696 --> 00:40:30,797
YOU'RE SO AMAZING.

1638
00:40:30,797 --> 00:40:31,698
WHEN YOU BELIEVE

1639
00:40:31,698 --> 00:40:32,666
IN YOUR UNIQUE BEAUTY,

1640
00:40:32,666 --> 00:40:33,700
YOU'RE GONNA HAVE A SHOT

1641
00:40:33,700 --> 00:40:34,801
AT A MODELING CAREER.

1642
00:40:34,801 --> 00:40:35,802
>> THANK YOU.

1643
00:40:35,802 --> 00:40:36,703
>> GOOD LUCK,

1644
00:40:36,703 --> 00:40:37,637
AND YOU'RE WELCOME.

1645
00:40:37,637 --> 00:40:38,605
>> THANK YOU VERY MUCH.

1646
00:40:38,605 --> 00:40:39,739
I HAD TROUBLE GETTING INTO

1647
00:40:39,739 --> 00:40:40,507
THE WHOLE PREMISE

1648
00:40:40,507 --> 00:40:41,675
OF THE COMMERCIAL, AND HONESTLY,

1649
00:40:41,675 --> 00:40:42,742
THAT WAS MY OWN ISSUE.

1650
00:40:42,742 --> 00:40:43,610
IF YOU'RE A MODEL,

1651
00:40:43,610 --> 00:40:44,844
YOU'RE SUPPOSED TO BE ABLE

1652
00:40:44,844 --> 00:40:45,545
TO GET INTO

1653
00:40:45,545 --> 00:40:47,214
WHATEVER THEY NEED YOU TO DO.

1654
00:40:47,214 --> 00:40:48,248
LIKE, I DON'T EVEN

1655
00:40:48,248 --> 00:40:49,082
NEED MY MOM HERE

1656
00:40:49,082 --> 00:40:49,983
TO SHAKE HER FINGER AT ME.

1657
00:40:49,983 --> 00:40:51,851
I'M SHAKING MY FINGER AT MYSELF.

1658
00:40:51,851 --> 00:40:52,819
I GOT THE LONG WALK.

1659
00:40:52,819 --> 00:40:54,187
I FEEL LIKE I'M GOING TO HEAVEN

1660
00:40:54,187 --> 00:40:55,188
OR SOMETHING.

1661
00:40:55,188 --> 00:40:56,223
WAVE GOOD-BYE!

1662
00:40:56,223 --> 00:40:56,990
(laughter)

1663
00:40:56,990 --> 00:40:58,091
>> IF I COULDN'T MUSTER

1664
00:40:58,091 --> 00:40:58,858
THE SEXUAL ENERGY

1665
00:40:58,858 --> 00:41:01,461
OR THE LITTLE COY THING GOING ON

1666
00:41:01,461 --> 00:41:03,096
THAT THEY NEEDED ME TO,

1667
00:41:03,096 --> 00:41:04,064
THEN--THEN I WASN'T

1668
00:41:04,064 --> 00:41:05,031
DOING MY JOB PROPERLY,

1669
00:41:05,031 --> 00:41:08,401
AND THAT'S MY OWN FAULT.

1670
00:41:14,875 --> 00:41:18,745
Captioned by
Closed Captioning Services, Inc.

